+</p>
+
+<ul>
+<li>
+<a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy-eea" target="_blank">
+Privacy Policy WhatsApp
+</a>
+</li>
+<li>
+<a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy" target="_blank">
+Privacy Policy Meta
